00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:28.430
Speaker 1: The core claim is that objective moral values and duties exist.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:35.670
Speaker 1: And the best explanation for objective morality is a transcendent moral law giver.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:41.870
