00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:38.290
Speaker 1: There is definite morality.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:52.120
Speaker 1: But then how do we know the reason why we have that morality or the reason why we can all point and look at something that is good and say that is good is because that morality must have come from a moral law giver.

