00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:29.020
Speaker 2: It says God is defined as the greatest possible being imaginable.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.150
Speaker 2: So they ask you, who.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:35.299
